  - guidHash: -1791123045
    text: +50 Mana
  - guidHash: -2104627240
    text: +50 Health
  - guidHash: 504265555
    text: +25 Mana
  - guidHash: -780414000
    text: A bunch of skulls
  - guidHash: -889915081
    text: Curse cleansed
  - guidHash: -847559478
    text: Curiosity satisfied
  - guidHash: 87161199
    text: Particle Accelerator
  - guidHash: -788461797
    text: Increases the speed and distance of your projectiles.
  - guidHash: -1742295566
    text: 'The device has a tiny print: "Please keep yourself at a safe distance
      of 100m while the accelerator is active, othervise you risk irradiation, death,
      catching the flu or spontaneous implosion."'
  - guidHash: 1662013330
    text: Dagger technique
  - guidHash: -916380048
    text: Toggle to switch between throwing pickaxe/daggers.
  - guidHash: -1342040812
    text: A manual written by Black Rabbit in hopes of teaching <s>the lowly peasants</s>
      her friends how to throw sharp objects.
  - guidHash: -425162211
    text: Uncharged Core
  - guidHash: 1632749843
    text: Can be activated to spend all your mana and reduce the cost of this by
      the same amount, when cost reaches 0 transforms into a powerful Arcana. Cost
      increases each floor.
  - guidHash: -1075931656
    text: It seems like this item needs a lot of mana to become useful. You are very
      intriqued by what it could do once it reaches its full potential.
  - guidHash: -304750388
    text: Cloak of Shadows
  - guidHash: 1096577254
    text: Temporarily makes you immune to damage and invisible to enemies after a
      dash. <br><color=#696969>(Has a cooldown that scales down with dexterity)</color>
  - guidHash: 383802409
    text: The legendary Cloak of Shadows itself. It is said that it allows it`s user
      to phase straight through any danger unscathed.
  - guidHash: 1904847233
    text: Red Berry
  - guidHash: -612014968
    text: Increases Stregth, your attacks ignite enemies.
  - guidHash: -107434539
    text: Ember Buddy
  - guidHash: 1506147180
    text: A burning friend who will help you in a fight by throwing fireballs at
      enemies.
  - guidHash: 2095813850
    text: Elemental Buddy
  - guidHash: -1144218441
    text: Upgrades for each other Elemental Buddy you have. <br>!!!CURENTLY NO OTHER
      BUDDIES ARE ADDED!!!
  - guidHash: 1345380625
    text: Fire elementals are generaly impish in their nature and have an explosive
      temper, but this one seems to like you.
  - guidHash: 980890281
    text: Blue Berry
  - guidHash: -174905027
    text: Increases inteligence, decreases the cost of your arcana.
  - guidHash: -66295737
    text: Green Berry
  - guidHash: -2080696167
    text: Increases Speed and Alacrity.
  - guidHash: -394457593
    text: Breeze Buddy
  - guidHash: -1217688055
    text: A breezy friend who helps you out by creating wind blasts that protect
      you from nearby projectiles and enemies by knocking them back.
  - guidHash: -619384835
    text: Cauldron
  - guidHash: 1279002410
    text: Allows you to brew potions using reagents. Reagents are now dropped from
      various places.
  - guidHash: 1954414562
    text: A tiny cauldron that is often used by beginner alchemists. It is in rough
      condition, but it will do the job. Now you just need to find something to brew
      with.
  - guidHash: 212299198
    text: Exploding Skulls
  - guidHash: -1979667702
    text: Some skulls turn into skullmines.
  - guidHash: -1984810009
    text: Uncertain Elixir
  - guidHash: -530726502
    text: Drinks a random potion.
  - guidHash: -1323287236
    text: A strange living brew that doesn`t know what it is. You wounder if it is
      even safe to drink.
  - guidHash: 944998563
    text: The skulls are mindblown after seeing Silksong release.
  - guidHash: -1452121465
    text: Ingredients
  - guidHash: 797723776
    text: Allow you to brew potions using the cauldron.
  - guidHash: -590886530
    text: Choose what to brew.
  - guidHash: 1102591738
    text: Healing Potion
  - guidHash: -1722359605
    text: Shield+
  - guidHash: 1062289849
    text: Permanently gives you an armor point.
  - guidHash: -1201049302
    text: This brew is said to make flesh as hard as steel.
  - guidHash: -461383102
    text: Ascender`s Bane
  - guidHash: 1440820202
    text: Has a chance to increase the level of one of your Ascendant Curses after
      clearing a room. If you don`t have an Ascendant curse, you gain one.
  - guidHash: -1686783852
    text: The stairway to succes is blocked by many obstacles.
  - guidHash: -1753300289
    text: Booster Shot
  - guidHash: -379518440
    text: Heals a great amount and gives a big boosts to stats that decays over time.
      There is now a chance to find small boosters in chests that restart this effect.
  - guidHash: 1387534447
    text: '"Sore throat? Broken bones? Had a bad sleep? Don`t worry, one tiny dose
      of this mixture fixes everything.  (Side effects include: uncontrollable laughter,
      depression, reincarnation, blindness, firebreath, lizard eyes, death, X1T3PO
      and headaches)"'
  - guidHash: 2117975759
    text: Cracked Vials
  - guidHash: 1962649897
    text: Some potions are now empty.
  - guidHash: -1891384301
    text: You should have handled these delicate glass bottles with more cautiousness
  - guidHash: -2008890055
    text: Empty Vial
  - guidHash: 840904051
    text: Does nothing.
  - guidHash: 1386675008
    text: The contents of this potion leaked out because there were cracks on the
      bottle.
  - guidHash: 1322930669
    text: Gardening Tools
  - guidHash: -66518776
    text: Makes Berry Bushes randomly appear in rooms. Picking up berries gives you
      temporary boosts.
  - guidHash: -207012784
    text: TromBone
  - guidHash: -801810071
    text: Raises a skeleton servant.
  - guidHash: -48727306
    text: This finely crafted insturement makes every note bone chilling.
  - guidHash: 2131799932
    text: Growing a fine garden is hard work, especially when you are doing it underground.
  - guidHash: 1880895732
    text: Guillotine
  - guidHash: -522589264
    text: Enemies sometimes drop skulls when they die.
  - guidHash: -526498288
    text: Encrusted Cranium
  - guidHash: -7610856
    text: Breaking skulls now drops some gold.
  - guidHash: 833414341
    text: From the most ancient times people always liked shiny things. Someone liked
      them so much that they carved them into their skulls.
  - guidHash: 726587114
    text: Pack Of Goodies
  - guidHash: -871912501
    text: Drops some usefull stuff, also drops some more when it is removed.
  - guidHash: 687139583
    text: Isn`t it a bit too early for christmass?
  - guidHash: 1171970070
    text: Embiggener
  - guidHash: -1521375507
    text: You projectiles grow in size with time and deal bonus damage depending
      on how big they are.
  - guidHash: 1830855627
    text: Eye Of Horus
  - guidHash: -638886367
    text: Removing a Curse heals the owner. Has a chance to immediately remove a
      curse upon receiving it.
  - guidHash: -2037836171
    text: The Pact
  - guidHash: 1658861709
    text: Lowers most of your stats, treasure rooms are now replaced with a special
      variants.
  - guidHash: 1087000018
    text: It will just cost you your soul.
  - guidHash: 1440129371
    text: Both will be your reward, should you complete the challenge.
  - guidHash: 890975758
    text: Brew something to help mend your wounds.
  - guidHash: 1382155085
    text: Brew something to help you fight.
  - guidHash: -1279285479
    text: Brew something rare.
  - guidHash: -15927909
    text: Brew an All-Potion
  - guidHash: -991840199
    text: Anti curse
  - guidHash: -164338048
    text: Brew something against curses.
  - guidHash: 2094599872
    text: +3 <color=#D3C7A9>reagent</color>
  - guidHash: -335367827
    text: The Eye Of Horus represents power, protection and good health. May it ward
      of any evil that comes your way.
  - guidHash: -1338926540
    text: Arcade Pistol
  - guidHash: -680463168
    text: Use it to shoot the targets in the arcade. Has limited ammo.
  - guidHash: -2121024769
    text: Well hello there traveler, interested in playing a game? All you need to
      do is shoot the targets over there. I will reward you depending on how well
      you do.
  - guidHash: 246690553
    text: 'It is going to cost you {flag:0f1a392d66e74129824819419181d571}<sprite
      name=gold>. Want to start now?[?]'
  - guidHash: 266179096
    text: Hah hah! Now that`s the spirit! Take this and let your aim be true.
  - guidHash: -1604100098
    text: If you change your mind, i am always here.
  - guidHash: -1100086377
    text: Good luck!
  - guidHash: -1407527175
    text: Arcade Master
  - guidHash: 523420320
    text: I hope you are happy with what you got, no second chances.
  - guidHash: 1157537984
    text: Take your shot, and when you are done, you can get the reward from my chest.
  - guidHash: 430071363
    text: It seems like your pockets are quite dry, come back when you have the gold.
  - guidHash: 2001997796
    text: No bullets
  - guidHash: 1868077253
    text: '{flag:ff35d19e9e294a38887f084641e3cbde} Bullets left'
  - guidHash: -122014490
    text: Bullets
  - guidHash: -72593658
    text: +Bullet
  - guidHash: -345847674
    text: Arcade Ticket
  - guidHash: 1635426197
    text: Enbales the spawn of arcades during this run. You need to pick this up
      at the start of each run.
  - guidHash: -680363311
    text: Arcades activated
  - guidHash: 775473763
    text: Lucky Bullet
  - guidHash: 1250477589
    text: Makes the Arcade Minigame spawn more often. Gives an extra bullet to shoot
      in the minigame. Grants a small amount of Luck.
  - guidHash: -165173212
    text: Due to a manufacturing error, this bullet has no gunpowder inside. Normally
      people will just throw this away, but you feel like you should keep it.
  - guidHash: 1694569806
    text: Merchant`s Brew
  - guidHash: 1560790939
    text: Sells food, keys, bombs and potion that lay on the ground.
  - guidHash: -399236800
    text: '"I am telling you, buying such quality meat for this price is a steal.
      What do you mean you saw me picking a random piece of meat from the floor?"'
  - guidHash: -1934629558
    text: Armor Pad
  - guidHash: -143065200
    text: Forgeable
  - guidHash: -889180000
    text: Can be forged to increase it`s effects.
  - guidHash: 550398301
    text: Forged
  - guidHash: 1759566448
    text: Effect upgraded.
  - guidHash: -976481585
    text: 'Grants 1 armor point. Releases a knockback blast when an Armor Point is
      damaged. <br><color=grey>Forged Effect: +1 Armor Point. Releases a fiery blast
      instead</color>'
  - guidHash: 1059011036
    text: Grants 2 armor points. Releases a releases a fiery blast when an Armor
      Point is damaged.
  - guidHash: 806468024
    text: Hammer In A Bottle
  - guidHash: -664369207
    text: Upgrade a Forgeable relic
  - guidHash: -588606516
    text: Jera
  - guidHash: 1521163369
    text: 'Gives rewards on floor start.<br><color=grey>Forged Effect: Better room
      clear rewards.</color>'
  - guidHash: 579493280
    text: Gives rewards on floor start. Better room clear rewards.
  - guidHash: -1527601366
    text: Loved by Kings, Emperors and French people.
  - guidHash: -16973071
    text: Lantern Powder
  - guidHash: 367644736
    text: Makes the fireballs from your lantern fly further and explode, dealing
      bonus damage in an area.
  - guidHash: 1311554136
    text: Nothing to Forge
  - guidHash: 793298101
    text: Gebo
  - guidHash: 1896190021
    text: 'Increases the stats of your followers. <br><color=grey>Forged Effect:
      Increases your Max Follower count.</color>'
  - guidHash: -67343827
    text: Harvest.
  - guidHash: -1599678138
    text: Partnership.
  - guidHash: 154026567
    text: Increases the stats of your followers and your Max Follower count
  - guidHash: 185996898
    text: Empty Pack Of Goodies
  - guidHash: 1709492854
    text: Doesn`t have anything left inside.
  - guidHash: -637310157
    text: Will reseal itself on your next run.
  - guidHash: 1476054839
    text: Two-Ton Tunic
  - guidHash: -1302413987
    text: Adds 2 Armor Points. Adds a cooldown to your jump/dash. When you land/your
      dash ends, create a huge shockwave.
  - guidHash: 612955308
    text: A strange purple masked ghost sometimes appears at the edge of your vision,
      i wonder what this is about?
  - guidHash: -1731627490
    text: Choose a relic to upgrade.
  - guidHash: 1722037196
    text: It seems like you have nothing to upgrade.
  - guidHash: 1791766263
    text: Dagaz
  - guidHash: -1135906109
    text: 'Intelligence now also grants Max Mana. <br><color=grey>Forged Effect:
      Increases the effectivenes of Intelligence blessings.</color>'
  - guidHash: 297889865
    text: Enlightenment.
  - guidHash: -922854202
    text: Inteligence now also grants Max Mana. Increases the effectivenes of Intelligence
      blessings.
  - guidHash: -350069960
    text: Fancy Dinner
  - guidHash: 866273231
    text: Adds 120 Maximum Health. Heals you to full health.
  - guidHash: 779859706
    text: '"Would you like some vine Sir?"'
  - guidHash: 1981674744
    text: Berserk`s Claw
  - guidHash: 1858000683
    text: Each melee hit on an enemy grants bonus Alacrity. This bonus resets if
      no enemy is hit for a while.
  - guidHash: -953157410
    text: '"I am not scared of a man who does 1 heavy swing every minute. I am terrified
      of a man who does 100 swings a second."'
  - guidHash: -99747051
    text: Blank
  - guidHash: 1958754595
    text: Knocks back nearby enemies and deals damage to them. Clears out all enemy
      projectiles on the screen and prevents new ones from appearing for a short
      time. <br><color=red>Screenflash Warning</color>
  - guidHash: 792635691
    text: Brought to you from a shady place called The Gungeon. What a weird name....
  - guidHash: 1830849791
    text: Experimental Formula
  - guidHash: -636699826
    text: Increases 2 random stats, then decreases 1 random stat.
  - guidHash: 1978938891
    text: I am not exactly sure what this will do.
  - guidHash: 23945956
    text: Shrine Of Greed
  - guidHash: 1376774573
    text: 'As you stare at a giant floating piece of gold, strange voices begin to
      fill your head. Surely nothing bad will happen if you touch it for just a second....
      <br>Do you take it?<br> [?]'
  - guidHash: 2051386039
    text: Greed
  - guidHash: -314455499
    text: Picking up gold nuggets damages you. The damage increases with each floor.
      Destroys itself after you pick up 75 nuggets.
  - guidHash: 1819695490
    text: Time to pay for your choices.
  - guidHash: -1463027668
    text: Shrine Of Sho`guul
  - guidHash: 115465560
    text: A shrine devoted to Sho`guul stands before you. You feel as if it awaits
      an offering.
  - guidHash: -1849864590
    text: Nothing to offer.
  - guidHash: 1343607241
    text: Choose what to sacrifice as an offering.
  - guidHash: -987347426
    text: Blessing Of Order
  - guidHash: -1430421482
    text: Order
  - guidHash: -1937544582
    text: Increases the effectiveness of 2 randomly chosen blessings.
  - guidHash: 2027374146
    text: Due to your generosity, Order herself has decided that you are worthy.
  - guidHash: -6887257
    text: Blood Vial
  - guidHash: -1464916221
    text: Fills up all Blood Offering statues in the room.
  - guidHash: -1757158763
    text: You don`t want to know where this blood is from.
  - guidHash: -852082947
    text: Heavy Pickaxe
  - guidHash: -744859677
    text: Adds 1 Armor Point. Each Armor Point now increases your strength.
  - guidHash: -854610375
    text: It might be a little hard to swing, but MAN does it pack a punch.
  - guidHash: -1506227987
    text: Rotten Elderseeds
  - guidHash: -752664610
    text: Elderseeds now damage you when picked up.
  - guidHash: -2116350556
    text: Due to a recent pest invasion in the kingdom, all the Elderseeds have gone
      bad.
  - guidHash: 338236064
    text: Mirror Shard
  - guidHash: 609238563
    text: Single Use! Duplicates EVERYTHING in the room.
  - guidHash: 1018353382
    text: Look
  - guidHash: -2033682547
    text: Boom Flask
  - guidHash: 1754818609
    text: Explodes on landing. <br>Has 2 uses.
  - guidHash: -1760586393
    text: Don`t drop this by accident.
  - guidHash: 711318234
    text: Flask
  - guidHash: -452119076
    text: A subtype of potions that are thrown instead of drunk. Usually have several
      uses.
  - guidHash: -899569352
    text: Greek Fire
  - guidHash: -1651197552
    text: Creates burning oil and ignites everything on landing. <br>Has 4 uses.
  - guidHash: 1761924806
    text: The salesmal convinced you that this fire lasts 99x longer than normal,
      but you are not sure if it is true.
  - guidHash: -780828716
    text: Inverse
  - guidHash: -160872264
    text: Phisycally attacking enemies sometimes heals them instead.
  - guidHash: -1530031345
    text: Look at the bright side, if you learn to contor this, then you are going
      to be an awesome healer.
  - guidHash: -1759834105
    text: Snow Globe
  - guidHash: 1226270022
    text: Appllies freeze to enemies in an area on landing. <br>Has 3 uses.
  - guidHash: 1167568602
    text: It looks beautiful when you shake it.
  - guidHash: 2068066549
    text: Lightning In A Bottle
  - guidHash: -185997757
    text: Creates a thundercloud that shocks enemies, stunning them briefly and dealing
      high damage. <br>Has 2 uses.
  - guidHash: 633585577
    text: '"You can`t catch lighting in a bottle they said, then what is this?"'
  - guidHash: 323694328
    text: Adventurer`s Revolver
  - guidHash: -730166479
    text: Fires deadly precise bullets that pierce infinitelly. Needs a reload every
      4 shots.
  - guidHash: -387306276
    text: Don`t bring a pickaxe to a gunfight.
  - guidHash: 33303959
    text: Old Metronome
  - guidHash: -56122719
    text: Every 3s deals damage to every enemy in the room.
  - guidHash: -1892661688
    text: It also helps you keep your rhytm!
  - guidHash: 215935902
    text: Vampiric Flask
  - guidHash: 1238944908
    text: Creates a swarm of bats that follow and steal life from enemies, giving
      it to the owner. <br>Has 3 uses.
  - guidHash: 1420459913
    text: Awwww they just want some blood.
  - guidHash: 701199328
    text: White Moon
  - guidHash: -1824881574
    text: Creates a wave of slashes.
  - guidHash: -1272700729
    text: Anime Style
  - guidHash: -332612558
    text: Skully
  - guidHash: 1295367233
    text: Orbits enemies and shoots at them.
  - guidHash: 1159427291
    text: Stone Mask
  - guidHash: -26787016
    text: You were turned into a vampire by the stone mask. Halves you MaxHP, but
      grants lifesteal on attacks.
  - guidHash: 601328554
    text: 'You see a strange stone mask lying on a table. Should you put it on?[?]'
  - guidHash: -1582309590
    text: You are already a vampire, the mask has no use for you.
  - guidHash: -1519116854
    text: Enable Minigame Spawn (Disabled fully in the current version, this does
      nothing)
  - guidHash: -1092739043
    text: D6
  - guidHash: -1927453049
    text: Spawns a dice when you enter a relic room. Picking up the dice rerols items
      in the room for free.
  - guidHash: -1101554888
    text: '"ISAAC!!!" - Mom'
  - guidHash: 1254107431
    text: Rerolls every relic in the room.
  - guidHash: -717277111
    text: Entropic Brew
  - guidHash: -1570662803
    text: Fill all your available potion slots with random potions.
  - guidHash: 1979829479
    text: Concentrated entropy. DO NOT INGEST!!!
  - guidHash: -1570680800
    text: Ambergris
  - guidHash: 2114299578
    text: Make a selected one of your Curses Sticky.
  - guidHash: 1861813069
    text: A foul smelling liquid of questionable origins. You can probably find a
      use for it.
  - guidHash: 572670490
    text: You don`t have any curses!
  - guidHash: -1187137587
    text: Hearth Locket
  - guidHash: -1114518308
    text: Taking damage launches a temporary <color=red>Hearth Crystal</color> pickup
      that restores a portion of the damage taken. Has a brief cooldown.
  - guidHash: -1439128877
    text: Helps those who are good on their feet to keep themselves healthy.
  - guidHash: -502829776
    text: Hidden Pocket
  - guidHash: -347466023
    text: Periodically throws out daggers whenever you use your ranged attack.
  - guidHash: 845114310
    text: '"Daggers can solve a lot of problems, especially if you have a lot of
      them"'
  - guidHash: 1712694073
    text: Blessed Curse Necklace
  - guidHash: -387545119
    text: Counts as 3 curses. Find Cursed Pearls in chests to incease the curse count
      further(up to 10 Max)
  - guidHash: 1597461384
    text: Sometimes, even curses can be helpful.
  - guidHash: -1034464094
    text: Does nothing. Counts as 3 curses. Additional Cursed Pearls could be found
      in chests that increase the curse count of this relic further(up to 10).
  - guidHash: 173498081
    text: Cursed Pearl
  - guidHash: 1945862755
    text: Increases the curse count of the Blessed Cursed Necklace.
  - guidHash: -1598507142
    text: "Coin Of Court\xE9s"
  - guidHash: -305869208
    text: On pickup, obtain 2 random curses. Increases gold gain from Gold Nuggets
      proportional to your Curses. Chance to drop a curse when breaking gold ore.
  - guidHash: -1752169056
    text: A single piece of gold from the cursed treasury. Despite everyone saying
      that you should return it, you are strangely compelled to keep it to yourself.
  - guidHash: -1452698726
    text: Cursestriker
  - guidHash: 483822223
    text: Rarely applies Curse Burn to enemies attacked in melee. Chance and damage
      increase with your curses.
  - guidHash: -1383024649
    text: Legends tell about a master Warlock, who was able to revert any curse sent
      at him back at his enemies. This blade is one of his creations.
  - guidHash: -605510479
    text: Taunting Face
  - guidHash: 974598845
    text: Throwing Axe Bundle
  - guidHash: -817549414
    text: Performing a swing periodically fires out an Axe.
  - guidHash: -1285956107
    text: From your experience, carrying around an Axe in your second hand is always
      a good idea.
  - guidHash: 1315149792
    text: Potion Possessiveness
  - guidHash: 1143158055
    text: Potion you pick up will have "possessive". "Possessive" potions can`t be
      dropped.
  - guidHash: -1061612744
    text: '"After all, why not? Why shouldn`t i keep it"'
  - guidHash: -971689969
    text: Possessive
  - guidHash: -1617647112
    text: Can not be dropped.
  - guidHash: -1413013135
    text: Thorns
  - guidHash: 517151040
    text: Throw out a flurry of thorns. Deals damage based on your Dexterity.
  - guidHash: -224901609
    text: Druid
  - guidHash: -1695439842
    text: Transformed
  - guidHash: -748094316
    text: Soul Burning Ink
  - guidHash: 1795759350
    text: Upgrades some talismans, giving them the ability to choose which curse
      gets removed.
  - guidHash: -1557426140
    text: Soul Burning Talisman
  - guidHash: -965396319
    text: Removes a selected Curse.
  - guidHash: -2107800926
    text: Bear
  - guidHash: 251370440
    text: Transform into a mighty Bear, gaining Physical damage resistance and MaxHP.
  - guidHash: 712844982
    text: Steel Spider
  - guidHash: -1747570633
    text: Tri-Whip
  - guidHash: -1114376367
    text: Your whip is now tripled.
  - guidHash: -307729938
    text: When enemies are many, the Inquisitor adapts.
  - guidHash: -2053337152
    text: Ornament Fan
  - guidHash: 1744708490
    text: Create a razor sharp gust of wind that pushes enemies away and damages
      them.
  - guidHash: 1837550058
    text: Unique <sprite name=dante>
  - guidHash: 1470760558
    text: This item will only drop for and can only be picked up by Dante.
  - guidHash: 527214832
    text: Exploding Barrel
  - guidHash: -421560033
    text: Throw out a barrel thar rolls forward with a short fuse. The barrel eplodes
      instantly if it is damaged or collides with an enemy.
  - guidHash: -60536820
    text: Empty Spell Book
  - guidHash: -1076636440
    text: Craft an Arcana with a custom effect.
  - guidHash: 1664826460
    text: In order to finish his apprenticeship, a young mage is tasked with creating
      his own spell from scratch.
  - guidHash: 2013548775
    text: 10 Mana
  - guidHash: -586555909
    text: 100 Mana
  - guidHash: -1679894113
    text: '{flag:1543aa89a58e4c3f80bc0c52dd6a6e16}'
  - guidHash: -710310422
    text: Simple Page
  - guidHash: 798162055
    text: Tome
  - guidHash: 1212115793
    text: Mending Stone
  - guidHash: -1953481664
    text: Slowly regenerates HP and Armor Shards while held. Breaks after reaching
      a threshold.
  - guidHash: 1189115764
    text: Mends both the body and the spirit(AND ARMOR TOO!!!)
  - guidHash: 1106094271
    text: Relic Shard
  - guidHash: 845139072
    text: <color=#0047AB>+1 Relic Shard</color>
  - guidHash: 1323198069
    text: Not enought shards
  - guidHash: 175904981
    text: 0
  - guidHash: 573713697
    text: Girya
  - guidHash: -1027516686
    text: 'Gives {flag:e411ec7865144a4f92c9116ff5a3f1a1} strength. Can be forged
      indefinitely.</color><br><color=grey>Forged Effect: Increases strength gained.
      </color>'
  - guidHash: -61605475
    text: Awakened Dagaz
  - guidHash: 998497568
    text: Awakened Gebo
  - guidHash: 6579380
    text: Awakened Jera
  - guidHash: 260609746
    text: Lift Girya, increasing the Str bonus by {flag:0e6c6be57bc44a549e9aabbdbeceb41b}.
  - guidHash: 969207223
    text: Lift
  - guidHash: -1915997389
    text: The Twins
  - guidHash: 1235799746
    text: A pair of constructs that complement your attacks.
  - guidHash: 729451091
    text: They are experts at doing "Pew Pew".
  - guidHash: 32213596
    text: Complement your Melee and Ranged attacks.
  - guidHash: 1673128487
    text: Improved base attacks.
  - guidHash: -1639773000
    text: New special attacks.
  - guidHash: 1376543934
    text: Have more than 25 Ingenuity.
  - guidHash: -1146991925
    text: New special attacks.
  - guidHash: -49971236
    text: Forge an upgrade module at the Foundry.
  - guidHash: -1988427079
    text: Forge an upgrade module at the Rune Anvil.
  - guidHash: -2081644926
    text: Ah, this is a new acquisition. I don`t quite have the materials to use
      it, but if you got any spare Shards laying around, and Relics in need of some
      forging, feel free to use it.
  - guidHash: 213957365
    text: Shatter
  - guidHash: 1654529452
    text: Please select a Relic or Arcana you would wish to break to receive Relic
      Shards.
  - guidHash: -100839604
